# T9AMAIL — TODO

## Working practice
- Edit on penguin only. VPS only runs `git pull`. Never edit there.
- Add files by name (`git add app.py`). NEVER `git add -A`: the repo
  holds other projects and map/ drive/ are untracked on purpose.
- Never touch ../map ../drive. Keep /switch and static/ticket.html.
- Deploy: push -> VPS `git pull` -> compile check -> switch.
    cd ~/T9A/mail && ./venv/bin/python -m py_compile app.py && echo OK
    then `/root/restart mail` (or switch from the phone).
    Recovery over SSH if mail fails: `/root/restart map`
- Rollback points: tags pre-webproto-merge, pre-reply-to.

